Z||000000||Haze_Performance||05-13-2001||06:48 PM||||Today I started the complete restoration of the interior of my '85. I already have most of the interior out. (<B>Everything</B> is being removed) After close inspection, I noticed some small stress cracks in some of the panels. I'm going to post my needs in the mall later......... I'm going to post some pics this week. Well its time to pull that dash out.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank><BR>           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/haze8588logo.gif">      </A>       <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/WS6_Fiero/photo.html" TARGET=_blank><BR>Pennock's Fiero Forum Members Photo Page</A><BR><I>If you want to add your Fiero to the collection, post or send me a photo. (Sent photos ONLY to: purplehazeracing@yahoo.com )</I><P><A HREF="http://www.clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero Club</A>||||reg||14
