Z||000008||KissMySSFiero||05-14-2001||09:43 PM||||haze.  i was told by another forum member(william) that the easiest way to get that door carpet off is to use mineral spirits.  it disolves the cement and the carpet falls off.  now ive never done this so i dont know how good it works.  it might not be a bad idea to get a junk panel to test it on.  good luck,  i get to do all that again soon.<P>------------------<BR>JOEJOE Aol:SSFiero <P>88FORMULA<BR>     <A HREF="mailto:SSFiero@Aol.com">SSFiero@Aol.com</A>      <P>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FORUMSIG1.jpg">          <BR>"When in Doubt..Whip it out!!"||||reg||1
